    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ERA Downey McCarthy are delighted to offer to the market this superbly presented and centrally located top floor apartment in a sought after and convenient location overlooking the River Lee and adjacent to Washington Street, within walking distance of UCC and the city centre. The property comes with a very convenient car space within this private, gated and secure development. \r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of reception hallway, spacious open plan kitchen/dining/living area, two bedrooms, and the bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Reception Hallway - 1.04m x 3.96m \r\nThe reception hallway has one centre light fitting, electric radiator, access to the attic and the hot press, and carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining/Living - 6.31m x 5.59m \r\nThis very spacious and open plan room has two light fittings, neutral décor, extensive dining space, and sliding doors allow access to a balcony area offering lovely views over the River Lee, Wandesford Quay and on towards St. Finbarr's Cathedral. The area has a mix of carpet flooring in the dining/living space, and vinyl flooring within the kitchen.\n\nThe kitchen has solid fitted units at eye and floor level with an extensive worktop counter and tile splashback. The kitchen includes an integrated oven/hob/extractor fan, a stainless steel sink, space for a fridge freezer, and space for a washing machine.  \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.97m x 2.43m \r\nThis double bedroom has one window overlooking the courtyard, fitted wardrobe unit, electric radiator, centre light fitting and carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.97m x 2.43m \r\nAnother double bedroom that has one window overlooking the courtyard, wardrobe units, electric radiator, centre light fitting and carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom - 1.69m x 1.99m \r\nThe bathroom features a four piece suite including a Mira Elite SE electric shower fitted over the bath, vinyl flooring and a frosted window.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Approx. 62.12 Sq. M. / 669 Sq. Ft.\r\nBuilt in 1994 \r\nBER C2\r\nElectric heating\r\nTwo double bedrooms\r\nSpacious open plan kitchen/dining/living area\r\nFreshly painted and decorated\r\nNew flooring throughout\r\nAccess to balcony area with river views\r\nAdjacent to Washington Street\r\nWalking distance to UCC & City Centre\r\nSought after central location"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C2\r\nBER No.119326577\r\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 195.51 kWh/m²/yr"
      },
